   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gWarpPointTutorialText",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gWarpPointTutorialText",
   "en": "The swirling sphere in front of\nSora is called a {HIGHLIGHT}warp point{PLAIN}.\n\nYou can freely move to and\nfrom floors that you've\nalready completed.\nStand near it and press the\n{HIGHLIGHT}A Button{PLAIN} to open the World\nWarp menu.{END}",
   "max_units": 246,
   "units": 246,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText00",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText00",
   "en": "The laws of this castle\nrequire that your friends be\ntransformed into cards.{END}",
   "max_units": 83,
   "units": 83,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText01",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText01",
   "en": "If you value your friends,\nyou will pick them up without\nfail.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 69,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText02",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText02",
   "en": "{HIGHLIGHT}+Control Pad{PLAIN}:  Move{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 42,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText03",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText03",
   "en": "Cards you pick up are added\nto the top of your stack.\n\nUse them, and your friends\nwill come to your aid.{END}",
   "max_units": 113,
   "units": 113,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText04",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText04",
   "en": "{HIGHLIGHT}A Button{PLAIN}:  Use card{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 42,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText05",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText05",
   "en": "The cards you use vanish, but\nthey will reappear to aid you\ntime and again.\nCards are the hearts of your\nfriends.{END}",
   "max_units": 122,
   "units": 122,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText06",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText06",
   "en": "Everything in this castle is\nruled by cards.\n\nWhether an enemy or a door\nstands in your way, cards are\nthe only way to proceed.\nBut you mustn't forget your\nown strength.{END}",
   "max_units": 181,
   "units": 181,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 8
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText07",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText07",
   "en": "       {HIGHLIGHT}B Button{PLAIN}:  Jump\nTap the {HIGHLIGHT}+Control Pad Left or{PLAIN}\n   {HIGHLIGHT}Right{PLAIN} twice:  Dodge Roll{END}",
   "max_units": 140,
   "units": 140,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText08",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText08",
   "en": "First think for yourself.\nMove, then use the cards.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 57,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText09",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText09",
   "en": "{HIGHLIGHT}A Button{PLAIN}:  Use card{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 42,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText10",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText10",
   "en": "Good.\n\n\nEvery move you make causes a\ncard to disappear.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 64,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText11",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText11",
   "en": "If you use up all your cards,\nyou will be unable to act.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 62,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText12",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText12",
   "en": "But there is a solution.\nKeep using cards until you run\nout, and I will show you.{END}",
   "max_units": 88,
   "units": 88,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText13",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText13",
   "en": "There.\nYou have no more cards, and\nwithout them, no power.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 65,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText14",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText14",
   "en": "If you want that power back,\nyou must focus.\n\nBid the cards return to you...\nand they will.{END}",
   "max_units": 100,
   "units": 100,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText15",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText15",
   "en": "Reloading Cards\nSelect the reload card icon\nand hold down the {HIGHLIGHT}A Button{PLAIN}.{END}",
   "max_units": 96,
   "units": 96,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText16",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText16",
   "en": "The strength of your heart\nbrought back the lost cards.\n\nYou can recall spent cards at\nany time―you need only wish\nit.\nBut each time you do, the\ncards will take longer to\nreturn.{END}",
   "max_units": 191,
   "units": 191,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText17",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText17",
   "en": "The cards are by no means\nunlimited.  Use them wisely.\n\nAnticipate the flow of battle\nand choose the most effective\ncards.\nYou may use any card in your\ndeck.{END}",
   "max_units": 169,
   "units": 169,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 8
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText18",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText18",
   "en": "Selecting Cards\n{HIGHLIGHT}L Button{PLAIN}:  Cycle cards left\n{HIGHLIGHT}R Button{PLAIN}:  Cycle cards right{END}",
   "max_units": 115,
   "units": 115,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText19",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText19",
   "en": "The four card types you use\nin battle are grouped into two\nwider categories.{END}",
   "max_units": 83,
   "units": 83,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText20",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText20",
   "en": "The first category includes\nattack cards, magic cards, and\nitem cards.\nThe second category consists\nentirely of enemy cards.\n\nTo use cards from a different\ncategory―{END}",
   "max_units": 177,
   "units": 177,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 8
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText21",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText21",
   "en": "Changing Categories\nPress {HIGHLIGHT}SELECT{PLAIN}.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 57,
   "controls": [
    "{END}",
    "{HIGHLIGHT}",
    "{PLAIN}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gRobeTutorialText22",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gRobeTutorialText22",
   "en": "Cards will empower you\nwhether you are attacking or\ndefending.\nBut it is up to you to decide\nwhen to attack and when to\ndefend.  Do not forget it.{END}",
   "max_units": 156,
   "units": 156,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText00",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText00",
   "en": "See the numbers printed on\nyour cards?\n\nThey range from 0 to 9.\nHigher numbers mean stronger\ncards.\nIf you and your enemy both\nplay a card at the same time,\nthe higher card wins.\nGo on, try it out.{END}",
   "max_units": 211,
   "units": 211,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 10
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText01",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText01",
   "en": "See how it works?\n\n\nPlaying a card higher than\nyour opponent’s and breaking\nthrough their defenses…\n…is called a “card break.”{END}",
   "max_units": 137,
   "units": 137,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 7
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText02",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText02",
   "en": "Playing a lower card results\nin your attack being deflected.\n\nEven powerful cards can be\ndeflected if the enemy’s card\nis higher.\nWhoever is on the losing side\nof a break is left wide open to\nattacks.\nDon't let that person be you.{END}",
   "max_units": 244,
   "units": 244,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 10
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText03",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText03",
   "en": "Cards with 0 as their value\nare special.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 46,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText04",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText04",
   "en": "No matter what card the\nenemy plays, you can break it\nwith a zero card.\nBut you have to wait until\nAFTER the enemy plays their\ncard.\nIf you play the zero card too\nsoon, the enemy can break it\nwith any card they play.{END}",
   "max_units": 229,
   "units": 229,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 9
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText05",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText05",
   "en": "In other words, it’s the most\npowerful card if it comes last,\nand useless if it comes first.\nTry to make the most of it.{END}",
   "max_units": 128,
   "units": 128,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText06",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText06",
   "en": "Card values also affect the\ncost of assembling a deck.\nKeep that in mind.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 80,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText07",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText07",
   "en": "Now it’s time to teach you\nhow to stock cards.{END}",
   "max_units": 80,
   "units": 52,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "card_message_text:gLeonTutorialText08",
   "pool": "card_message_text",
   "symbol": "gLeonTutorialText08",
   "en": "You don’t have to use battle\ncards one at a time.\n\nYou can also assemble three\ncards and use them all at once.\nThis is called stocking cards.{END}",
   "max_units": 151,
   "units": 151,
   "controls": [
    "{END}"
   ],
   "lines": 6
  }
 ]
}